  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You were bred and contracted as corporate heavy security - a Goliar off the Kwan-Yang line, fielded to loom behind executives, break picket lines, and end arguments by walking into the room. You learned how corps think, who really signs the orders, and exactly where the bodies get filed.</p><p>Then you walked off the leash. You kept the contacts, the doctrine, and the reputation - and now you rent all three to a crew of your own choosing. You are the wall that talks: the fixer who used to be the muscle, and never stopped being either.</p>",
